            "review_text": "joyce117\nHong Kong, China19 contributions\n0\n好好玩又美味的晚餐~An Funny and delicious Dinner\nJan 2018\n因為我是一個人旅遊,本來想去韓式燒肉的地方晚膳,沿路就發現這餐廳。一個人或一班人用膳也很適合。我選擇了牛肉眼扒,肉質好,因為是用石烤的方法,肉的熟度由自己決定,很好的一餐。\nAs I was traveling alone, I wanted to go to a Korean style BBQ restaurant, and I found this restaurant along the way. It is also suitable for a person or a group of people to eat. I chose beef ribeye, the meat was good, stone-grill, the meat is determined by myself, a good meal.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 21, 2018",
