            "review_text": "Jasminele313\nHong Kong, China26 contributions\n2\nOut of profession and terrible attitude\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nActually this is the first time I searched about this restaurant. I called this restaurant to make reservation for my guests . I contacted this phone number 0983 474969 and i met a guy, I thought he’s the manager of the restaurant. I asked some information about the restaurant for my guests and any discount for the bill if we have dinner there. Finally he shouted on me and said ‘ I just have discount for tour guide, no discount for the others ‘ . I asked him why and he got angry with me by the rude way. I couldn’t imagine that a manager of a big restaurant can have this attitude to customer. Although I didn’t use their services, no one knows I will be their customer in the future or not, maybe i can help them introduce some guests. His attitude can show us that this restaurant is not professional, do not know how to suffer from many kinds of guests. Customers are always right! Although they are wrong, we have to know how to treat them well and let them know that they are not right actually. Please think carefully before you choose this restaurant. Thanks\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 2, 2018",
